ideo></div><br><br><strong>To report any bugs or to join our community and find other roleplaying enthusiasts visit our Discord server </strong>",
    "short_description": "In a world of endless possibilities your tale is unwritten. Experience classic ttrpg's like never before as you roll dice, build worlds, and roleplay in the bodies of the creatures you create. Bring life to your stories with Legends And Lore. For Desktop (keyboard and mouse) and VR",
